t uploaded it yet in this chat session, but the system prompt shows a placeholder record). Actually, looking at the system prompt, there is a \"Recent Medical Record Summary\" which shows \"[2026 年 4 月 18 日] 医疗报告：检查报告\". This suggests I should be ready to discuss reports.\n    *   However, since the user just asked \"Who are you\", I don't need to push the report immediately unless they bring it up, but mentioning I can help with reports is good.\n\n5.  **Final Polish (in Chinese):**\n    我是 Spark 健康助手。我致力于为您提供**准确、简洁、可执行**的健康建议。\n\n    无论是**解读检查报告**、咨询症状，还是提供日常健康管理方案，都可以随时问我！您现在有什么想了解的？\n\n6.  **Review against constraints:**\n    *   Accurate? Yes.\n    *   Concise? Yes.\n    *   Actionable? Yes (invites questions).\n    *   User language? Yes (Chinese).\n\n7.  **Final Output Generation.** (Matches the drafted polish).","reasoning_duration_ms":3777,"reasoning_expanded":false,"reasoning_visibility":"full"}]}
